{"term": {"label": "道", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 17, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "使", "id": "使"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "執", "id": "執"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "志", "id": "志"}, {"form": "忘", "id": "忘"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "正", "id": "正"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "殉", "id": "殉"}, {"form": "殺", "id": "殺"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "立", "id": "立"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}, {"form": "道", "variants": [], "id": "道"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.0159205728229963, "source": "人", "target": "忘"}, {"weight": 0.03509131981127019, "source": "人", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 0.16862271243579272, "source": "人", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.421385680931161, "source": "人", "target": "志"}, {"weight": 0.7282385003712155, "source": "人", "target": "殺"}, {"weight": 0.7282385003712155, "source": "人", "target": "盡"}, {"weight": 1.0159205728229963, "source": "人", "target": "殉"}, {"weight": 0.322773392263051, "source": "人", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 2.6741486494265287, "source": "忘", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.421385680931161, "source": "忘", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "忘", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 3.079613757534693, "source": "立", "target": "命"}, {"weight": 2.6741486494265287, "source": "立", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 1.0001722158548572, "source": "立", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.13370360847938, "source": "立", "target": "道"}, {"weight": 2.268683541318364, "source": "聞", "target": "殉"}, {"weight": 0.728238